"╔═════════════════════════════════════════════ Ctrl+w ═════════════════════════════════════════════╗"
"║ w, Ctrl+w, p The other panel                                                                     ║"
"║ h            The left panel                                                                      ║"
"║ l            The right panel                                                                     ║"
"║ x, r         Swap the panels                                                                     ║"
"║ f            Open the directory under the cursor in the other panel                              ║"
"║ v            Show this directory in the other panel                                              ║"
"║ 1            Change the left panel's location: a volume or a host                                ║"
"║ 2            Change the right panel's location: a volume or a host                               ║"
"╚═════════════════════════════════════════════════ Ctrl+k lists, Esc closes, Backspace goes back ══╝"
